 revealed that jeremy  renner is starting to get back in shape  for the role of hawkeye and he said that  he hasn't worked out for the role in  a very long time but i'm sure he won't  have a problem getting back in shape  now right now it's planned on being  released in fall of 2021  and the hawkeye producers and writers  have all followed haley steinfeld  on instagram and it's pretty much all  but confirmed that she is indeed going  to be playing kate bishop in the hawkeye  series it's also rumored that they may  be exploring a  comic route where hawkeye was actually  deaf and that he'll go deaf in the  hawkeye series somehow  but we'll have to wait until fall of  2021 to find out  and then in the lineup we have the  eternals now the eternals got pushed  way back by a year the original release  date was supposed to be november 6th of  2020 and now it is coming out on  november 5th  of 2021. now right now it's in  post-production the reshoots actually  just finished and most of the movie  including post-production is pretty much  complete  and of course the big question about the  eternals is when are we going to be  getting this  trailer well right now there's a lot of  talk about us getting it with the  release of  black widow which means we would have to  wait until may to  finally see the trailer but that is  probably when we can expect it to come  out because that's six months before the  film  and then we have the movie that probably  has the most hype around it right now  spider-man 3. now whether it's called  homesick home worlds whatever  fans are super excited for spider-man 3  and the potential for a huge  multiverse film it's been rumored that  there are a ton of people returning from  other franchises to this movie including  toby maguire spider-man and andrew  garfield spider-man  as well now it was originally planned  for july 16th of 2021 but unfortunately  it has been pushed back to december 17th  of 2021  and recently over the past couple of  weeks